      <p class="itcb-note">* Precios orientativos seg&uacute;n estado. Valoramos cualquier modelo.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="itcb-r">
      <div class="itcb-stats">
        <div class="itcb-stat">
          <span class="itcb-stat-n">Bizum</span>
          <span class="itcb-stat-l">Pago inmediato</span>
        </div>
        <div class="itcb-stat">
          <span class="itcb-stat-n">2h</span>
          <span class="itcb-stat-l">Oferta m&aacute;x.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="itcb-stat itcb-stat-g">
          <span class="itcb-stat-n">Gratis</span>
          <span class="itcb-stat-l">Recogida</span>
        </div>
        <div class="itcb-stat itcb-stat-g">
          <span class="itcb-stat-n">48h</span>
          <span class="itcb-stat-l">Precio fijo</span>
